<h2>Try a week of noticing</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Pick a realistic activity plan. Don't add every possible session.</li>
  <li>Write down the type of activity and how hard it felt.</li>
  <li>Note your sleep and how you feel the next day.</li>
  <li>Change things slowly, and take symptoms and recovery seriously.</li>
</ol>
<p>Our <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/">seven-day journal</a> has space for these notes. It's a tool for noticing, not a treatment plan.</p>

